{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "note": "Maps a locator to the roles that locator can legitimately play, so an upstream Agent cannot promote a source by asserting a source_kind. Unknown hosts are reported as unverifiable rather than assumed innocent or guilty. Rule matching picks the single most specific rule: host_suffix plus the longest matching path_prefix.",
